<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Pivot raises Gibson's bid price.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Pivot raises Gibson's bid price.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gibson's Ltd said on Wednesday Pivot Nutrition Pty Ltd has raised its takeover offer for the group to A$6.00 per share from A$4.80 and extended the offer until February 16.  </p>
<p>Pivot currently owns 56.98 percent of Gibson's, which is a flour and stockfeed miller.</p>
<p>Gibson's shares rose 24 cents or 4.6 percent to A$5.35 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
